Kimi K3 is available on @baseten in collaboration with vLLM!

Baseten provides a fast, reliable production API for Kimi K3 with vLLM as a part of the inference stack. You can call the 2.8-trillion-parameter model now, without managing any of the infrastructure yourself.

@vllm_project  × @baseten × @Kimi_Moonshot

Kimi K3 is available on @digitalocean, served by vLLM!

vLLM handles serving K3 efficiently; DigitalOcean makes it straightforward to deploy and scale on familiar infrastructure. Full 2.8T model with 1M-token context, available at launch.

@vllm_project  × @digitalocean × @Kimi_Moonshot

Kimi K3 runs on @modal since Day 0 - powered by vLLM!

vLLM provides the serving engine; Modal exposes it as a production endpoint that scales on demand. One deploy gets you the full model, and it grows with your traffic.

